      "content": "i see. so you're saying it's an innate fact? i just wonder if there's any reason to present the other side, like if someone thinks it's more of a social thing or a lifestyle choice rather than something you're born with. shouldn't i mention that some people see it differently so my kid gets the whole picture?",
